### Auth Service API Examples

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/health

### 2. Get Supported Providers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/providers

### 3. Register - Local Authentication
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john_doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "provider": "LOCAL"
}

### 4. Register - Another User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jane_smith",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "securepass456",
  "provider": "LOCAL"
}

### 5. Login with Username - Local
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "john_doe",
  "password": "password123",
  "provider": "LOCAL"
}

### 6. Login with Email - Local
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "securepass456",
  "provider": "LOCAL"
}

### 7. Failed Login - Wrong Password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "john_doe",
  "password": "wrongpassword",
  "provider": "LOCAL"
}

### 8. Failed Login - User Not Found
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "nonexistent_user",
  "password": "password123",
  "provider": "LOCAL"
}

### 9. OAuth Login - Google (Simulation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/oauth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accessToken": "google_test_token_12345",
  "provider": "GOOGLE",
  "email": "testuser@gmail.com",
  "username": "testuser",
  "providerId": "google_123456789"
}

### 10. OAuth Login - GitHub (Simulation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/oauth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accessToken": "github_test_token_67890",
  "provider": "GITHUB",
  "username": "githubuser",
  "providerId": "github_987654321"
}

### 11. Register - Validation Error (Short Username)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ab",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "provider": "LOCAL"
}

### 12. Register - Validation Error (Invalid Email)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "password123",
  "provider": "LOCAL"
}

### 13. Register - Validation Error (Short Password)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "12345",
  "provider": "LOCAL"
}

### 14. Register - Duplicate Username
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john_doe",
  "email": "different@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "provider": "LOCAL"
}

### 15. Register - Duplicate Email
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "different_user",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "provider": "LOCAL"
}

